    "animation": "0.00–1.04s: hold the tipped pouch with tokens still inside; only a slight wrist adjustment. 1.04–2.70s: the customer's left hand tips farther, releasing the five existing tokens in one gravity-driven cascade onto the glass. 2.70–3.65s: they bounce into an irregular pile; Wlodek's visible hand stops the last brass ear. 3.65–4.65s: he looks over his glasses at the customer with a raised eyebrow and sly closed-mouth smile. Reach End composition by 4.65s and hold naturally through 6.00s. Camera: short eight-centimeter push toward the landing area during pouring. Preserve identity, hands, token designs and glass. No friendly grin, duplicated loot, levitation, cuts or text. Edit uses source 1.042–5.042s. Wlodek stays silent with lips closed; no speaking or lip-sync.\n@Image1 locks the existing Wlodek's identity only; @Image2 locks the existing rune's engraving and silhouette. Preserve all five tokens and their Start/End scale, no additions."
